  "body": "Enjoy the best of Orewa living in this stunning Generation Homes House & Land Package at Ara Hills.\r\n\r\nSurrounded by native greenery and just minutes from Orewa beach, shops, and essential amenities, this 150.01m² home on a beautifully positioned 325m² section is priced from only $1,199,000. This Plan has been designed specifically to suite the site, offering comfort, convenience, and tranquil bush views in a well-connected community.\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\n- 150.01m² floor area\r\n- 3 bedrooms\r\n- 2.5 bathrooms\r\n- Open-plan kitchen, dining, and living area\r\n- Full designer kitchen with walk-in pantry\r\n- Double garage with designated laundry space for washer and dryer\r\n- Dining porch\r\n- Outdoor deck flowing off the living area\r\n\r\nDesigned with downsizers and retirees in mind, this contemporary home offers a practical, low-maintenance layout that combines comfort, style, and everyday functionality.\r\n\r\nStep into the Langley Plan and be welcomed by a central hallway that leads you into the heart of the home: an open-plan kitchen, dining, and living area. The thoughtfully designed gallery-style kitchen overlooks the living spaces and features a discreetly positioned walk-in pantry, providing ample storage while maintaining a clean, modern aesthetic. The living and dining areas flow effortlessly onto a generous outdoor deck, creating the perfect setting for entertaining guests or enjoying relaxed outdoor living.\r\n\r\nPositioned on the left wing of the home are three spacious double bedrooms. The master suite offers a private retreat, complete with a walk-in wardrobe and ensuite. The remaining two bedrooms each include built-in wardrobes and are conveniently serviced by a stylish family bathroom. An additional hallway cupboard provides valuable storage space for linens and everyday essentials.\r\n\r\nCompleting the home is a double garage with a dedicated laundry area, including space for a washer, dryer, and laundry tub. With direct internal access to the entrance and hallway, unloading groceries or bringing items in from the car is both simple and convenient.\r\n\r\nAssuring you we provide fixed-price contracts and a guaranteed completion date, giving you certainty and peace of mind. Since 1997, we’ve successfully completed over 6,800 homes on time and within budget across New Zealand.\r\n\r\n*Images are from a previous Show Home to show our build quality.\r\n\r\n*Project budget based on assumed specification, final pricing is subject to purchaser requirements.\r\n\r\nContact Norman or Nadine to secure this House and Land Package today!",
